cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Statistical Analysis of Molecular Docking-Derived Binding Energies Distribution"
type: software

abstract: >
  R code for statistical analysis of molecular docking-derived
  binding-energy values across JAK1, JAK2, JAK3, and TYK2.

keywords:
  - molecular docking
  - JAK isoforms
  - phytochemicals
  - flavonoids
  - Wilcoxon rank-sum test
  - Holm correction

repository-code: "https://github.com/kritigupta1999/Statistical-Analysis"

message: "Please cite the associated publication when using this repository."
